{
    "background_story": "Shelby was a free-spirited food blogger with a passion for Italian cuisine. Growing up in a small town in the Midwest, she spent countless hours watching cooking shows and experimenting with new recipes. But it wasn't until she stumbled upon a quaint trattoria in Rome that she discovered her true love: tagliatelle. The long, flat noodles danced in her mouth, coated in rich, velvety sauces that left her wanting more. Inspired by the experience, Shelby created a blog dedicated to the art of pasta-making, with tagliatelle as her crowning jewel. Her recipes and stories quickly gained a following, and soon she was invited to cook at culinary festivals across Italy. Shelby's love for tagliatelle had taken her on a journey she never could have imagined, and she was forever grateful for the taste of Italy that had changed her life.",
